    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665740/extras/bea543a02c2eee6bb33dffe5d606c108.avif?t=1695002129\" /></div><br>Book Of Potentia 2 is a dungeon crawler where you play as a sorceress on her journey to retrieve her stolen spell book. <br>Team up with a friend or go alone and fight against a range of enemies with unique attacks and weaknesses. <br>Collect coins and earn temporary buffs for your 4 unique spells (Fire, Earth, Wind, and Ice).<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Controller Support<br></li><li>Procedurally generated maps<br></li><li>Local Co-Op 2-Players (Requires two xbox 360 controllers)</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665740/extras/6bdfbd3f1488a98b6398c3a663ac68f7.avif?t=1695002129\" /></div>",
